    newContent: { en: "Grammar: Future forms review — will, going to, present continuous for arrangements. | Vocabulary: Education (10 lexical items) | Expressions: News Summarizing", pt: "Grammar: Future forms review — will, going to, present continuous for arrangements. | Vocabulary: Education (10 itens lexicais) | Expressions: News Summarizing" },
